flowchart TD
    A[Message available in processing queue] --> B[Lambda receives message]
    B --> C{Processing succeeds?}
    C -->|Yes| D[Message acknowledged and removed]
    C -->|No| E[Message becomes available for retry]
    E --> F{Receive count exceeds redrive limit?}
    F -->|No| B
    F -->|Yes| G[Move message to dead-letter queue]
    G --> H[Alert and investigate failure]
    H --> I[Fix root cause and validate replay plan]
    I -. Controlled redrive when safe .-> A
    classDef success fill:#E8F8F1,stroke:#16845B,color:#103D2B;
    classDef failure fill:#FFF0EF,stroke:#C2413B,color:#4A1212;
    class D success;
    class E,G,H failure;
